{
  "rule": "legacy-employment-status",
  "description": "Maps the derived status and pending insurance filings to the legacy Korean employment status shown in the old employee list.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "file": "apps/api/legacy/src/modules/hr/legacy/legacy.utils.ts",
      "lines": "4-31"
    }
  ],
  "inputSchema": {
    "hasRegistrationNumber": "Whether the employee has a registration number.",
    "status": "Derived status.",
    "pendingFilings": "Kinds of pending 4대보험 filings: ACQUISITION (join), LEAVE (leave of absence), LOSS (resignation)."
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no registration number is 임시저장",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": false,
        "status": "JOINED",
        "pendingFilings": [
          "LOSS"
        ]
      },
      "expected": "임시저장",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "pending loss wins",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "LEAVE",
        "pendingFilings": [
          "ACQUISITION",
          "LEAVE",
          "LOSS"
        ]
      },
      "expected": "퇴사처리중",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "pending leave over join",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "JOINED",
        "pendingFilings": [
          "ACQUISITION",
          "LEAVE"
        ]
      },
      "expected": "휴직처리중",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "pending join",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "JOINED",
        "pendingFilings": [
          "ACQUISITION"
        ]
      },
      "expected": "입사처리중",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "on leave",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "LEAVE",
        "pendingFilings": []
      },
      "expected": "휴직",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "resigned",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "RESIGNED",
        "pendingFilings": []
      },
      "expected": "퇴사",
      "derivation": "traced"
    },
    {
      "name": "pre-joined shows as 재직",
      "input": {
        "hasRegistrationNumber": true,
        "status": "PRE_JOINED",
        "pendingFilings": []
      },
      "expected": "재직",
      "derivation": "traced"
    }
  ],
  "openQuestions": [
    "재설계는 이 상태를 저장하지 않고 status·warnings·insuranceFilings로 나눕니다. 이관 때 처리중 상태를 열린 신고(PENDING)로 옮기면 될까요",
    "입사 전 직원이 현행 목록에서 재직으로 보이는 것을 재설계 PRE_JOINED로 바꿔도 될까요"
  ]
}
